  "prefLabel": "Odb 402.21 Project cost ledger",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 402.21 “Project cost ledger” means a department-approved electronic spreadsheet, accounting software, or other electronic application or system, that itemizes all costs and charges to a fund-eligible project, and ties those costs and charges to a general ledger accounting system.\n\nSource. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
